        <text key="Deny: The current command execution is rejected. The agent loop is interrupted.">拒绝：拒绝执行当前命令。代理循环被中断。</text>
        <text key="Execute Once: The current command runs once. The next RUN_COMMAND will request authorization again.">执行一次：当前命令执行一次。下一次 RUN_COMMAND 将再次请求授权。</text>
        <text key="Execute Always: Allows this exact command in this specific folder without asking again, but ONLY until the application is closed. These permissions do not persist across app restarts.">始终执行：允许在特定文件夹中执行此精确命令，无需再次询问，但仅限于关闭应用程序之前。这些权限在重新启动应用程序后不会保留。</text>
